    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1009.0092v1</id>
    <title>A Similarity Analysis for Heat Transfer in Newtonian and Power Law Fluids Using the Instantaneous Wall Shear Stress</title>
    <updated>2010-09-01T05:26:35Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1009.0092v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1009.0092v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>This paper presents a technique that collapses existing experimental data of heat transfer in pipe flow of Newtonian and power law fluids into a single master curve. It also discusses the theoretical basis of heat, mass and momentum analogies and the implications of the present analysis to visualisations of turbulence.</summary>
